Package: nova-c-driver-manager
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Nova-C OS <novacore.iq@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-apt, isenkram-cli, nvidia-detect, pciutils, usbutils, kmod, kdialog, konsole, pkexec, polkitd, dbus-bin, network-manager, mokutil
Description: Nova-C OS hardware driver finder
 Recognises devices that need extra drivers (NVIDIA graphics, Broadcom and old
 Intel Wi-Fi, missing firmware, and anything Debian maps to a hardware ID), and
 once the computer is online asks the user whether to download and install them.
 Also available from the menu as "Hardware Drivers".
